{"vid":"QCeKytICohs","source":"QCeKytICohs.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.1,"txt":"In November of 2023, I lost my position due to"},{"t":3.9,"txt":"reduction in force."},{"t":5.1,"txt":"I immediately started applying for jobs."},{"t":7.5,"txt":"I had reached out previously to recruiters that I knew,"},{"t":11.4,"txt":"people that I had worked with before."},{"t":13.3,"txt":"Although I had somewhat of a network in this area where I"},{"t":15.9,"txt":"live, none of that proved fruitful."},{"t":18.7,"txt":"Fast forward to late summer of 2025,"},{"t":22.5,"txt":"I found the reverse recruiting concept."},{"t":25.2,"txt":"I reached out to the reverse recruiting agency and"},{"t":29,"txt":"applied to basically be on their client list."},{"t":31.8,"txt":"What they were able to do was get me some"},{"t":33.7,"txt":"opportunities at interviews,"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"and eventually, after about two months here"},{"t":38,"txt":"in December of 2025, I did get a job offer and"},{"t":41,"txt":"then started on January 5th of 2026."},{"t":43.6,"txt":"The decision that went into using reverse recruiting was"},{"t":47.2,"txt":"definitely a shift in thinking for me."},{"t":49.9,"txt":"It was driven by the job market,"},{"t":52.7,"txt":"by the economy, and just by my own"},{"t":55.7,"txt":"experience where I wasn't seeing any positive results"},{"t":59.6,"txt":"from from my individual efforts."},{"t":64.5,"txt":"In traditional recruiting, companies pay recruiters to"},{"t":67.7,"txt":"find candidates for open positions."},{"t":69.8,"txt":"In reverse recruiting, job seekers pay recruiters"},{"t":72.6,"txt":"to help them land a job."},{"t":74.1,"txt":"The concept isn't new, but the current job market"},{"t":76.4,"txt":"is so weak that it's expanding the practice."},{"t":79.4,"txt":"I'd say two distinct business models for reverse"},{"t":82.5,"txt":"recruiting. One, folks will charge you"},{"t":84.6,"txt":"monthly, and sometimes they'll guarantee an outcome"},{"t":87.7,"txt":"such as a job offer."},{"t":89.2,"txt":"And if you don't receive the offer,"},{"t":91.2,"txt":"they'll keep working with you until they do. Our model"},{"t":93.7,"txt":"is quite different in that we do charge a monthly fee,"},{"t":96.9,"txt":"but the majority of our revenue comes from what's"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"called a success fee."},{"t":100.5,"txt":"Upon securing an offer, they pay 10% of their year"},{"t":103.5,"txt":"one base salary and they are refunded their first month's"},{"t":106.4,"txt":"fee."},{"t":107.6,"txt":"Knic Ebel, who used Shinkarofsky's recruiting"},{"t":109.5,"txt":"service, says this business model appealed to him."},{"t":112.5,"txt":"The fee that I would pay after having secured another"},{"t":117,"txt":"role really made a lot of sense because I'd be giving"},{"t":119.8,"txt":"up a salary, a full-time salary or a small"},{"t":122.8,"txt":"percentage, in this case of a full-time salary."},{"t":125.5,"txt":"Or I could just continue trying to find something on"},{"t":128,"txt":"my own which wasn't working."},{"t":129.3,"txt":"So I absolutely felt like it was the right decision."},{"t":132.8,"txt":"Alex Shinkarovsky launched Reverse Recruiting Agency in"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"2024 with just three clients."},{"t":138,"txt":"So far, he says he has worked with 45 clients"},{"t":140.6,"txt":"who've completed the program,"},{"t":142.2,"txt":"including 22 who landed job offers and six who landed"},{"t":145.6,"txt":"offers on their own."},{"t":147.1,"txt":"I think why reverse recruiting has seen such"},{"t":150.3,"txt":"really an astronomic growth in both search volume,"},{"t":153.6,"txt":"website visits, clients signing up with us"},{"t":156,"txt":"and competitors because people don't know the"},{"t":159.2,"txt":"formula for success in this market."},{"t":161.2,"txt":"Economists say rising interest in reverse"},{"t":163.2,"txt":"recruiting reflects a weakening labor market,"},{"t":165.4,"txt":"where finding a job is becoming more competitive"},{"t":168.2,"txt":"day by day."},{"t":169.3,"txt":"The February jobs report was rather disappointing."},{"t":171.9,"txt":"The data showed us that we lost 92,000 jobs across the"},{"t":175,"txt":"economy. Unemployment crept up to 4.4%,"},{"t":178.7,"txt":"and it comes on the heels of what has been a very"},{"t":180.8,"txt":"disappointing 2025 for the labor market as well."},{"t":184.9,"txt":"If you are a job seeker right now and the time to"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"hire has actually increased, meaning it takes you longer"},{"t":190.6,"txt":"to find a job, to hear back from an"},{"t":193,"txt":"employer, and to hopefully get a job offer,"},{"t":195.5,"txt":"that can be incredibly frustrating,"},{"t":197.7,"txt":"right? And we're seeing a lot more applications per"},{"t":201.1,"txt":"job as well. So we just have more job seekers finding"},{"t":204.4,"txt":"fewer jobs. So I think it's really important to keep in"},{"t":206.8,"txt":"mind that the job market is a lot more competitive for"},{"t":210.9,"txt":"job seekers right now."},{"t":212.8,"txt":"One of the main factors for why hiring has slowed"},{"t":215.4,"txt":"significantly over the last few years is the economy."},{"t":218.5,"txt":"We've lived in a higher interest rate environment,"},{"t":221,"txt":"and that disproportionately affected a lot of those"},{"t":223.8,"txt":"white collar sectors like tech,"},{"t":225.9,"txt":"finance and professional services."},{"t":227.8,"txt":"So until we start to see interest rates really come"},{"t":230.3,"txt":"down, I don't expect to see a lot of momentum there."},{"t":233,"txt":"So if you are in a white collar role,"},{"t":234.8,"txt":"it is a difficult time to find a job,"},{"t":236.7,"txt":"which is why we do see some folks looking elsewhere and"},{"t":239.6,"txt":"considering things like reverse recruiting."},{"t":241.6,"txt":"AI tools have also made it easier for job seekers to"},{"t":244.3,"txt":"quickly update their resumes and cover letters and apply"},{"t":247.4,"txt":"to many jobs at once."},{"t":249,"txt":"That's creating a bottleneck for hiring teams."},{"t":251.6,"txt":"A lot of AI tools have kind of flattened the playing"},{"t":254.2,"txt":"field. It's a lot easier to get help to apply to jobs"},{"t":257.7,"txt":"and to widely apply."},{"t":259.8,"txt":"But that also means the noise is kind of picked up."},{"t":262.4,"txt":"We're hearing stories of a lot of job seekers,"},{"t":264.6,"txt":"instead of applying to five jobs,"},{"t":266.1,"txt":"they're applying to 105 jobs."},{"t":268.3,"txt":"Employers are getting a whole lot more applications."},{"t":271.2,"txt":"Some people, faced with intense market competition,"},{"t":274.1,"txt":"might be willing to pay for what feels like a partner to"},{"t":276.9,"txt":"navigate a challenging search."},{"t":278.5,"txt":"In this world of AI and increased technology,"},{"t":281.5,"txt":"we are also reaching out to humans again to help us find"},{"t":284.5,"txt":"jobs and to actually engage with someone that you can"},{"t":287.2,"txt":"talk to. It's like me constantly pressing zero on"},{"t":289.3,"txt":"the phone to talk to a representative. That's"},{"t":291.2,"txt":"literally what this is."},{"t":292.5,"txt":"And that to me is really interesting."},{"t":294.4,"txt":"So the human is still very much in the loop."},{"t":296.5,"txt":"Some worry reverse recruiting gives an"},{"t":300,"txt":"advantage to those who can afford it,"},{"t":301.7,"txt":"while others warn about the risk of scams."},{"t":304.4,"txt":"One of the concerns around reverse recruiting is that"},{"t":307,"txt":"for those folks who can't afford it,"},{"t":308.5,"txt":"they'll be less competitive in the job market,"},{"t":310.6,"txt":"even if they have the skill set."},{"t":312.2,"txt":"I just have a number of concerns."},{"t":313.8,"txt":"One, you don't necessarily know the credentials of this"},{"t":315.9,"txt":"person that's like representing you out in the"},{"t":317.5,"txt":"world. Two, it could actually be deemed"},{"t":320.1,"txt":"fraudulent by some companies,"},{"t":321.8,"txt":"and so that could negatively impact your ability to work"},{"t":324.1,"txt":"there now or at any point in the future."},{"t":326,"txt":"Three I think there are some reverse recruiters that are"},{"t":328.4,"txt":"double dipping. So they're being paid by employers, and"},{"t":330.5,"txt":"they're also trying to make money off of candidates."},{"t":332.6,"txt":"After doing his own research."},{"t":334.3,"txt":"Howard Pan decided to try it himself."},{"t":336.5,"txt":"He turned to a reverse recruiting service after"},{"t":338.8,"txt":"being laid off from Amazon Web Services in January."},{"t":342.2,"txt":"However, he says job seekers shouldn't rely on just one"},{"t":345.2,"txt":"method when searching for work."},{"t":347,"txt":"I would not use this service as the only method of job"},{"t":351.5,"txt":"seeking. I would use reverse recruiters as a complement"},{"t":355.2,"txt":"to the traditional way of job seeking,"},{"t":357.9,"txt":"such as through LinkedIn, through a recruiter reaching"},{"t":360.7,"txt":"out, through in-person hiring events,"},{"t":363,"txt":"hiring fairs, things like that."},{"t":364.9,"txt":"I think that reverse recruiting may not be a fit"},{"t":367.3,"txt":"for everyone, especially those that may be"},{"t":369.8,"txt":"new to the workforce, that have not established a"},{"t":372.5,"txt":"career yet or very early on,"},{"t":374.8,"txt":"and maybe just don't have a couple of years of"},{"t":377,"txt":"experience."},{"t":377.9,"txt":"Some of the advice I would give someone who is"},{"t":379.4,"txt":"considering hiring a reverse recruiter is do your"},{"t":382.2,"txt":"research. You need to understand that person's"},{"t":384,"txt":"background. Do they understand the industry"},{"t":386.1,"txt":"you're in? Get extensive referrals."},{"t":388.2,"txt":"Make sure that these are legitimate referrals, not"},{"t":390.4,"txt":"just names this person is giving you."},{"t":392.5,"txt":"Like you need to really do your research."},{"t":394.4,"txt":"Check Reddit, Trustpilot, where people"},{"t":396.7,"txt":"will often post about scams that they fall for,"},{"t":399,"txt":"like look for evidence that this is a reputable person"},{"t":403.5,"txt":"to represent you in the world."},{"t":405,"txt":"You need to be hands-on."},{"t":406.2,"txt":"Because the reality is, if they misrepresent your"},{"t":408.2,"txt":"experience, then you might just end up spending a lot"},{"t":411.2,"txt":"of money on these services without really getting the"},{"t":413.9,"txt":"results you want."},{"t":415,"txt":"Like many trends, once people learn something,"},{"t":417.1,"txt":"they tend to stick with it."},{"t":418.3,"txt":"So we might see this persist,"},{"t":420.2,"txt":"but I expect as the job market improves,"},{"t":422.6,"txt":"people will find opportunities and they won't"},{"t":424.5,"txt":"need to rely so much on expert recruiting."}],"words":[{"t":0.12,"w":"In"},{"t":0.12,"w":"November"},{"t":0.12,"w":"of"},{"t":0.12,"w":"2023,"},{"t":0.12,"w":"I"},{"t":0.12,"w":"lost"},{"t":0.12,"w":"my"},{"t":0.12,"w":"position"},{"t":0.12,"w":"due"},{"t":0.12,"w":"to"},{"t":3.92,"w":"reduction"},{"t":3.92,"w":"in"},{"t":3.92,"w":"force."},{"t":5.08,"w":"I"},{"t":5.08,"w":"immediately"},{"t":5.08,"w":"started"},{"t":5.08,"w":"applying"},{"t":5.08,"w":"for"},{"t":5.08,"w":"jobs."},{"t":7.48,"w":"I"},{"t":7.48,"w":"had"},{"t":7.48,"w":"reached"},{"t":7.48,"w":"out"},{"t":7.48,"w":"previously"},{"t":7.48,"w":"to"},{"t":7.48,"w":"recruiters"},{"t":7.48,"w":"that"},{"t":7.48,"w":"I"},{"t":7.48,"w":"knew,"},{"t":11.36,"w":"people"},{"t":11.36,"w":"that"},{"t":11.36,"w":"I"},{"t":11.36,"w":"had"},{"t":11.36,"w":"worked"},{"t":11.36,"w":"with"},{"t":11.36,"w":"before."},{"t":13.28,"w":"Although"},{"t":13.28,"w":"I"},{"t":13.28,"w":"had"},{"t":13.28,"w":"somewhat"},{"t":13.28,"w":"of"},{"t":13.28,"w":"a"},{"t":13.28,"w":"network"},{"t":13.28,"w":"in"},{"t":13.28,"w":"this"},{"t":13.28,"w":"area"},{"t":13.28,"w":"where"},{"